{
    "openapi": "3.0.0",
    "info": {
        "title": "NutriLens Partner API",
        "description": "**Snap your food. See your nutrition.**\n\nThe NutriLens Partner API turns a meal — either a photograph of one or a\nstructured list of foods — into calories and macronutrients.\n\n## Getting started\n\n1. Create an API key in NutriLens under **Developer → API keys**.\n2. Copy it when it is shown. It is stored only as a hash, so it cannot be\n   displayed again.\n3. Click **Authorize** above, paste the key, and try `GET /api/v1/ping` —\n   it verifies the key without spending an AI call.\n\n## Authentication\n\nSend the key as a bearer token on every request:\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer nl_live_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\n```\n\n`X-API-Key: <key>` is also accepted for clients that reserve the\nAuthorization header.\n\n## Response shape\n\nEvery response — success or failure — uses one of two envelopes:\n\n```json\n{ \"success\": true,  \"data\":  { ... } }\n{ \"success\": false, \"error\": { \"code\": \"INVALID_IMAGE\", \"message\": \"...\" } }\n```\n\nBranch on `error.code`, which is a closed and documented set. Never parse\n`error.message`; it is written for humans and may change.\n\n## Rate limits\n\nLimits are applied per API key, not per IP.\n\n| Endpoint | Per minute | Per day |\n|---|---|---|\n| `POST /nutrition/analyze` | 10 | 250 |\n| `POST /nutrition/estimate` | 30 | 1000 |\n| `GET /ping` | 120 | — |\n\nA `429` response carries a `Retry-After` header.\n\n## These are estimates\n\nNutriLens estimates nutrition; it does not measure it. Values are derived\nfrom a model's reading of a photograph or of a food description, and carry a\ncalibrated `confidence` for exactly that reason. Nothing this API returns is\nmedical or nutritional advice, and it must not be presented to end users as\neither.",
        "contact": {
            "name": "NutriLens API support",
            "email": "api@nutrilens.test"
        },
        "license": {
            "name": "Proprietary"
        },
        "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    "servers": [
        {
            "url": "http://localhost:8000",
            "description": "This deployment"
        }
    ],
    "paths": {
        "/api/v1/nutrition/analyze": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Nutrition"
                ],
                "summary": "Analyse a meal photograph",
                "description": "Upload a photograph of a meal and receive a nutrition estimate for every\nfood the model can identify: portion, calories, protein, carbohydrates,\nfat, and a calibrated confidence per item.\n\nThe image is re-oriented, downscaled and re-encoded before it is sent to\nthe vision provider, and is **not stored** — partner uploads are held in\nmemory for the duration of the request only.\n\nEvery figure returned is an estimate.",
                "operationId": "analyzeNutritionImage",
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "multipart/form-data": {
                            "schema": {
                                "required": [
                                    "image"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
                                    "image": {
                                        "description": "JPEG, PNG or WebP. Max 12 MB, at least 64x64 pixels.",
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "binary"
                                    },
                                    "reference": {
                                        "description": "Optional identifier of your own, echoed back in the response.",
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "nullable": true,
                                        "maxLength": 120
                                    }
                                },
                                "type": "object"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Nutrition analysis",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NutritionSuccess"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing, invalid or revoked API key",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "413": {
                        "description": "Upload larger than the server accepts",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Invalid image, unsupported format, or no food detected",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "description": "Rate limit exceeded",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "502": {
                        "description": "The AI returned an unusable result",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "AI unavailable or not configured",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "ApiKeyAuth": []
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/nutrition/estimate": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Nutrition"
                ],
                "summary": "Estimate nutrition for structured foods",
                "description": "Send the foods and portions you already know and receive nutrition for\nexactly those foods, in the same order, in the same response shape as the\nimage endpoint.\n\nPortions are echoed back unchanged: the estimate is for the quantity you\nsent, and unit conversion is deliberately not performed on your behalf.\n\nEvery figure returned is an estimate.",
                "operationId": "estimateNutrition",
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EstimateRequest"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Nutrition estimate",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NutritionSuccess"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing, invalid or revoked API key",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation failed",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "description": "Rate limit exceeded",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "502": {
                        "description": "The AI returned an unusable result",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "AI unavailable or not configured",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "ApiKeyAuth": []
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/ping": {
            "get": {
                "tags": [
                    "Status"
                ],
                "summary": "Verify an API key",
                "description": "Confirms that your API key is valid and active, and reports the limits\nand accepted portion units for this deployment.\n\nCosts nothing and calls no AI provider — the right first request to make\nwhen setting up an integration.",
                "operationId": "partnerPing",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "The key is valid",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "success": {
                                            "type": "boolean",
                                            "example": true
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                            "properties": {
                                                "authenticated": {
                                                    "type": "boolean",
                                                    "example": true
                                                },
                                                "api_version": {
                                                    "type": "string",
                                                    "example": "v1"
                                                },
                                                "key": {
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "name": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "example": "Acme staging"
                                                        },
                                                        "prefix": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "example": "nl_live_a1b2c3"
                                                        },
                                                        "created_at": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "date-time"
                                                        },
                                                        "last_used_at": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "date-time",
                                                            "nullable": true
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "type": "object"
                                                },
                                                "limits": {
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "analyze_per_minute": {
                                                            "type": "integer",
                                                            "example": 10
                                                        },
                                                        "analyze_per_day": {
                                                            "type": "integer",
                                                            "example": 250
                                                        },
                                                        "estimate_per_minute": {
                                                            "type": "integer",
                                                            "example": 30
                                                        },
                                                        "estimate_per_day": {
                                                            "type": "integer",
                                                            "example": 1000
                                                        },
                                                        "max_image_megabytes": {
                                                            "type": "integer",
                                                            "example": 12
                                                        },
                                                        "max_items_per_estimate": {
                                                            "type": "integer",
                                                            "example": 20
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "type": "object"
                                                },
                                                "portion_units": {
                                                    "type": "array",
                                                    "items": {
                                                        "type": "string"
                                                    },
                                                    "example": [
                                                        "g",
                                                        "ml",
                                                        "oz",
                                                        "cup",
                                                        "slice",
                                                        "serving"
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "type": "object"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing, invalid or revoked API key",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "description": "Rate limit exceeded",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "ApiKeyAuth": []
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    },
    "components": {
        "schemas": {
            "NutritionItem": {
                "title": "Nutrition item",
                "description": "One food, with nutrition for the portion given.",
                "properties": {
                    "name": {
                        "description": "The root of the OpenAPI document: metadata, servers, the API-key security\nscheme, and the schemas shared across partner endpoints.\n\nEndpoint definitions live as attributes on the controllers that implement\nthem, so a route and its documentation cannot drift apart unnoticed.",
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "Grilled chicken breast"
                    },
                    "portion_amount": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "format": "float",
                        "example": 150
                    },
                    "portion_unit": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "g",
                        "enum": [
                            "g",
                            "ml",
                            "oz",
                            "fl oz",
                            "cup",
                            "tbsp",
                            "tsp",
                            "slice",
                            "piece",
                            "serving",
                            "bowl",
                            "plate"
                        ]
                    },
                    "calories": {
                        "description": "kcal for this portion.",
                        "type": "integer",
                        "example": 248
                    },
                    "protein": {
                        "description": "Grams for this portion.",
                        "type": "number",
                        "format": "float",
                        "example": 46
                    },
                    "carbs": {
                        "description": "Grams for this portion.",
                        "type": "number",
                        "format": "float",
                        "example": 0
                    },
                    "fat": {
                        "description": "Grams for this portion.",
                        "type": "number",
                        "format": "float",
                        "example": 5
                    },
                    "confidence": {
                        "description": "0–1. Below 0.55 means the value should be reviewed before it is relied on.",
                        "type": "number",
                        "format": "float",
                        "example": 0.92
                    }
                },
                "type": "object"
            },
            "NutritionTotals": {
                "title": "Nutrition totals",
                "description": "The sum of every item. Always consistent with the `items` array.",
                "properties": {
                    "calories": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "example": 620
                    },
                    "protein": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "format": "float",
                        "example": 48
                    },
                    "carbs": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "format": "float",
                        "example": 72
                    },
                    "fat": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "format": "float",
                        "example": 14
                    }
                },
                "type": "object"
            },
            "NutritionSuccess": {
                "title": "Nutrition response",
                "properties": {
                    "success": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "example": true
                    },
                    "data": {
                        "properties": {
                            "meal_name": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "example": "Chicken Rice Bowl"
                            },
                            "confidence": {
                                "description": "Overall confidence, 0–1. Reflects the weakest meaningful part of the analysis rather than the average.",
                                "type": "number",
                                "format": "float",
                                "example": 0.88
                            },
                            "totals": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NutritionTotals"
                            },
                            "items": {
                                "type": "array",
                                "items": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NutritionItem"
                                }
                            },
                            "notes": {
                                "description": "One sentence on anything limiting the estimate, or null.",
                                "type": "string",
                                "example": null,
                                "nullable": true
                            },
                            "model": {
                                "properties": {
                                    "provider": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "example": "anthropic"
                                    },
                                    "name": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "example": "claude-opus-5"
                                    }
                                },
                                "type": "object"
                            },
                            "disclaimer": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "example": "All values are estimates and are not medical or nutritional advice."
                            },
                            "reference": {
                                "description": "Present only if you sent one.",
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true
                            }
                        },
                        "type": "object"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object"
            },
            "EstimateRequest": {
                "title": "Structured estimate request",
                "required": [
                    "items"
                ],
                "properties": {
                    "meal_name": {
                        "description": "Optional. Kept verbatim in the response if supplied.",
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "Post-gym lunch",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "maxLength": 120
                    },
                    "items": {
                        "description": "One to 20 foods. Results come back in the same order.",
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                            "required": [
                                "name",
                                "portion_amount",
                                "portion_unit"
                            ],
                            "properties": {
                                "name": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "example": "Chicken breast",
                                    "maxLength": 120,
                                    "minLength": 2
                                },
                                "brand": {
                                    "description": "Optional. Lowers confidence if unrecognised rather than being invented.",
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "nullable": true,
                                    "maxLength": 120
                                },
                                "portion_amount": {
                                    "type": "number",
                                    "format": "float",
                                    "example": 150
                                },
                                "portion_unit": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "example": "g",
                                    "enum": [
                                        "g",
                                        "ml",
                                        "oz",
                                        "fl oz",
                                        "cup",
                                        "tbsp",
                                        "tsp",
                                        "slice",
                                        "piece",
                                        "serving",
                                        "bowl",
                                        "plate"
                                    ]
                                }
                            },
                            "type": "object"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "example": {
                    "meal_name": "Post-gym lunch",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "name": "Chicken breast",
                            "portion_amount": 150,
                            "portion_unit": "g"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Brown rice",
                            "portion_amount": 1,
                            "portion_unit": "cup"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Broccoli",
                            "portion_amount": 90,
                            "portion_unit": "g"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            },
            "ErrorResponse": {
                "title": "Error",
                "description": "Every failure uses this shape. Branch on `error.code`.",
                "properties": {
                    "success": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "example": false
                    },
                    "error": {
                        "properties": {
                            "code": {
                                "description": "A closed set:\n\n`MISSING_API_KEY`, `INVALID_API_KEY`, `REVOKED_API_KEY`,\n`EXPIRED_API_KEY`, `FORBIDDEN`, `VALIDATION_FAILED`,\n`INVALID_IMAGE`, `UNSUPPORTED_FILE_TYPE`, `FILE_TOO_LARGE`,\n`NOT_FOUND`, `RATE_LIMITED`, `NO_FOOD_DETECTED`,\n`AI_UNAVAILABLE`, `AI_NOT_CONFIGURED`, `AI_INVALID_RESPONSE`,\n`INTERNAL_ERROR`.",
                                "type": "string",
                                "example": "INVALID_IMAGE"
                            },
                            "message": {
                                "description": "Human-readable. Do not parse.",
                                "type": "string",
                                "example": "The uploaded image could not be processed."
                            },
                            "details": {
                                "description": "Field-level context, present on validation failures.",
                                "type": "object",
                                "nullable": true,
                                "additionalProperties": true
                            }
                        },
                        "type": "object"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object"
            },
            "ValidationErrorResponse": {
                "title": "Validation error",
                "properties": {
                    "success": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "example": false
                    },
                    "error": {
                        "properties": {
                            "code": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "example": "VALIDATION_FAILED"
                            },
                            "message": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "example": "The request could not be validated."
                            },
                            "details": {
                                "type": "object",
                                "example": {
                                    "items.0.portion_unit": [
                                        "`portion_unit` must be one of: g, ml, oz, fl oz, cup, tbsp, tsp, slice, piece, serving, bowl, plate."
                                    ]
                                },
                                "additionalProperties": true
                            }
                        },
                        "type": "object"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object"
            }
        },
        "securitySchemes": {
            "ApiKeyAuth": {
                "type": "http",
                "description": "Your NutriLens API key, e.g. `nl_live_a1b2c3...`. Paste the key itself — Swagger adds the `Bearer ` prefix.",
                "scheme": "bearer"
            }
        }
    },
    "tags": [
        {
            "name": "Status",
            "description": "Key verification and API metadata"
        },
        {
            "name": "Nutrition",
            "description": "Nutrition analysis and estimation"
        }
    ]
}